msgid "Your proposed original purpose"
msgstr "你提出的原用途"

#. copy/identified
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/identified"
msgid "Original purpose reconstructed by the office"
msgstr "鑑定所重建的原用途"

#. copy/operation
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/operation"
msgid "Likely operation"
msgstr "可能操作方式"

#. copy/caution
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/caution"
msgid "Limit the conclusion must not erase"
msgstr "不得被結論洗掉的限制"

#. copy/nextUse
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/nextUse"
msgid "New Gensokyo use"
msgstr "幻想鄉新用途"

#. copy/assigned
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/assigned"
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "去處"

#. copy/agencyResult
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/agencyResult"
msgid "Agency reading"
msgstr "意志判讀"

#. copy/panel
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/panel"
msgid "Four-party marginal opinions"
msgstr "四方會議頁邊意見"

#. copy/correction
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/correction"
msgid "This file also corrects an earlier contested appraisal"
msgstr "本案同時訂正一份較早的爭議案卷"

#. copy/retainedBy
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retainedBy"
msgid "Retention signatory"
msgstr "同意保留者"

#. copy/retentionReason
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retentionReason"
msgid "Reason retained"
msgstr "保存理由"

#. copy/share
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/share"
msgid "Copy file link"
msgstr "複製案卷連結"

#. copy/shared
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/shared"
msgid "Case-file link copied."
msgstr "案卷連結已複製。"

#. copy/openBbs
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openBbs"
msgid "See what the BBS did with it"
msgstr "去看 BBS 怎麼吵"

#. copy/startAnother
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/startAnother"
msgid "Appraise this object again"
msgstr "回到這件物品再做一次鑑定"

#. copy/archiveTitle
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/archiveTitle"
msgid "Appraisal files retained on this device"
msgstr "這台裝置保存的鑑定案卷"

#. copy/archiveLead
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/archiveLead"
msgid "Each appraisal keeps its evidence and corrections. Reappraisal opens a separate file."
msgstr "每次鑑定都保存證據與修訂，重新鑑定則另立一卷。"

#. copy/noArchive
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/noArchive"
msgid "No files yet. Kourindou says this means everything remains not for sale for now."
msgstr "尚無案卷。香霖堂說這代表所有東西都還可以暫不出售。"

#. copy/openRecord
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openRecord"
msgid "Open file"
msgstr "查看案卷"

#. copy/status
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/status"
msgid "Finding"
msgstr "結論"

#. copy/date
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/date"
msgid "Bound"
msgstr "裝訂時間"

#. copy/drafts
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/drafts"
msgid "Unfinished drafts"
msgstr "未結草稿"

#. copy/continueDraft
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/continueDraft"
msgid "Continue appraisal"
msgstr "繼續鑑定"

#. copy/retentionTitle
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retentionTitle"
msgid "Keep this disputed appraisal?"
msgstr "保留這份存疑鑑定？"

#. copy/retentionLead
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retentionLead"
msgid ""
"The selected purpose lacks supporting evidence. You can keep the file with a "
"reason for retaining it; it will be marked UNSUPPORTED and may prompt BBS "
"replies."
msgstr "證據不足以支持所選用途。你可附上理由保留案卷；它會標示「依據不足」，並可能引來BBS回應。"

#. copy/retentionWarning
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retentionWarning"
msgid "The UNSUPPORTED mark stays on this appraisal in saved files, My TU, and BBS references."
msgstr "已存案卷、My TU與BBS引用，都會保留「依據不足」標示。"

#. copy/reviewer
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/reviewer"
msgid "Reviewer willing to sign retention"
msgstr "願意署名保留的審閱者"

#. copy/reason
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/reason"
msgid "Why it deserves a record"
msgstr "為什麼值得保存"

#. copy/reasonPlaceholder
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/reasonPlaceholder"
msgid ""
"For example: a representative misreading, a useful new test question, or the "
"object itself insists on this use…"
msgstr "例如：能保留一種具代表性的誤認、形成新的可驗證問題，或物品本身堅持這個用途……"

#. copy/confirm
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/confirm"
msgid ""
"I understand that evidence did not support this proposed original purpose "
"and still request a contested record."
msgstr "我明白這項原用途沒有得到證據支持，仍要求以爭議案卷保存。"

#. copy/cancel
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/cancel"
msgid "Return it to the bench"
msgstr "拿回桌上重做"

#. copy/bind
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/bind"
msgid "Bind in red pencil and let the BBS answer for itself"
msgstr "用紅鉛筆裝訂，讓 BBS 自行負責"

#. copy/retentionIncomplete
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/retentionIncomplete"
msgid "Choose a signatory, state a reason, and confirm the warning."
msgstr "請選擇署名者、寫下保存理由並確認警告。"

#. copy/outsiderDesk
#: src/js/appraisal.js:30
msgctxt "tree:copy#/outsiderDesk"
msgid ""
"Outside objects are not riddle props. They were used, superseded, made "
"unrepairable—and only then arrived here."
msgstr "外界物不是謎語道具；它們曾經被使用、淘汰、修不好，然後才抵達這裡。"
